use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(17577.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(18077.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(18466.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D70B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D70B\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, the dark fringe forms at O.</p>\n<p>Hence, option (A) is correct.</p>\n<p>The shape of wavefronts from both sources for D &gt;&gt; d is semi-circular, which are concentric with each other with the difference just in their phase resulting in concentric semicircular interference fringes. That is, the region nearby point O is dark.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l0rab3wv/20df9477-e2b8-4bb2-8aa3-8eac71cf9364/17b4f1f0-a3e7-11ec-9889-8ff85cf85963/file-1l0rab3ww.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l0rab3wv/20df9477-e2b8-4bb2-8aa3-8eac71cf9364/17b4f1f0-a3e7-11ec-9889-8ff85cf85963/file-1l0rab3ww.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2016 Paper 2 Offline Physics - Wave Optics Question 18 English Explanation\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1l0rab3wv/20df9477-e2b8-4bb2-8aa3-8eac71cf9364/17b4f1f0-a3e7-11ec-9889-8ff85cf85963/file-1l0rab3ww.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1l0rab3wv/20df9477-e2b8-4bb2-8aa3-8eac71cf9364/17b4f1f0-a3e7-11ec-9889-8ff85cf85963/file-1l0rab3ww.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l0rab3wv/20df9477-e2b8-4bb2-8aa3-8eac71cf9364/17b4f1f0-a3e7-11ec-9889-8ff85cf85963/file-1l0rab3ww.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1l0rab3wv/20df9477-e2b8-4bb2-8aa3-8eac71cf9364/17b4f1f0-a3e7-11ec-9889-8ff85cf85963/file-1l0rab3ww.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1l0rab3wv/20df9477-e2b8-4bb2-8aa3-8eac71cf9364/17b4f1f0-a3e7-11ec-9889-8ff85cf85963/file-1l0rab3ww.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1l0rab3wv/20df9477-e2b8-4bb2-8aa3-8eac71cf9364/17b4f1f0-a3e7-11ec-9889-8ff85cf85963/file-1l0rab3ww.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>Hence, option (B) is correct.</p>\n","exam":"jee-advanced"}]}